  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhancing Demand-Side Governance of the Road Administration</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed grant aims at enhansing the participatory performance monitoring and evaluation of the Kazakhstan Roads Administration by building capacity of Ministry of Transportation to effectively engage civil society organizations and project beneficiaries in implementation of transport projects in Kazakhstan.  TF014526 The objective of the project is to introduce modern demand side governance diagnostics in transport projects and establish mechanisms for effective local community engagements with Ministry of Transportation and Communications (MoTC).</narrative>
  </description>
